{
  "uid": "marin-rl-sync-generation",
  "title": "RL Post-training (sync): generation",
  "description": "Drill-down of RL Post-training (sync) into `generate`. The top rows read the driver's `generate` spans and rollout wait counters. The vLLM row mounts Inference diagnostics panels for this run. Those panels need a time range of 7 hours or less.",
  "tags": [
    "marin",
    "rl",
    "sync",
    "generated"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "linkRef": "rl_post_training"
    },
    {
      "linkRef": "rl_sync_train_step"
    },
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Inference",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/marin-inference?var-identity_kind=run_id&var-identity=${run}"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "cw-rno2a,cw-us-east-02a,cw-us-east-08a,marin,marin-dev",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "run",
        "label": "Run",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
          "uid": "finelog-marin"
        },
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 0,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "query": {
          "queryType": "infinity",
          "refId": "variable-run",
          "infinityQuery": {
            "refId": "variable-run",
            "type": "json",
            "source": "url",
            "format": "table",
            "parser": "backend",
            "url": "/query",
            "url_options": {
              "method": "GET",
              "params": [
                {
                  "key": "sql",
                  "value": "SELECT run_id AS value FROM \"telemetry_v1.marinskyrl\" WHERE service = 'marinskyrl' AND name = 'policy_step' AND COALESCE(json_get(resource_attributes_json, 'training_loop'), '') <> 'async' AND COALESCE(NULLIF(\"cluster\", ''), 'marin') IN (${cluster:sqlstring}) AND timestamp_ms >= CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{from}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) AND timestamp_ms < CAST(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM {{to}}) * 1000 AS BIGINT) AND run_id IS NOT NULL GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY MAX(timestamp_ms) DESC"
                },
                {
                  "key": "from",
                  "value": "${__from}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "to",
                  "value": "${__to}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "columns": [
              {
                "selector": "value",
                "text": "value",
                "type": "string"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "How much of the step is generate?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 300,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "generate: share of each child span",
      "description": "`generate`'s direct child spans as shares of `generate`. `rollout_collect` is the fan-out over trajectories. `generate_span_residual` should stay near zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisLabel": "share of the generate wall",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "No generate child spans. This runner or build does not publish them. The generate total is on Step composition.",
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.series}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "targetRef": "rl_run",
          "url": "/v1/rl/generation",
          "view": "generate_breakdown",
          "format": "timeseries",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "t",
              "text": "time",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            },
            {
              "selector": "series",
              "text": "series",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "value",
              "text": "value",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-trajectory wait: rollout_engine_await and rollout_env_await",
      "description": "`_seconds_sum` ÷ `rollout_trajectory_count` for `rollout_engine_await` and `rollout_env_await`, and `rollout_engine_await_seconds_max`. The sums overlap across coroutines, so the series do not stack. `rollout_engine_await` is the caller's wait on the inference client. For callers that pass text, it includes chat templating on the driver thread.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisLabel": "seconds per trajectory"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "No rollout wait counters. This build or runner does not publish them.",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "targetRef": "rl_run",
          "url": "/v1/rl/generation",
          "view": "trajectory_wait",
          "format": "timeseries",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "t",
              "text": "time",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            },
            {
              "selector": "engine_wait_per_trajectory",
              "text": "engine_wait_per_trajectory",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "env_wait_per_trajectory",
              "text": "env_wait_per_trajectory",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "engine_await_max",
              "text": "engine_await_max",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is it the tail, or the whole batch?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 310,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "rollout_engine_await: slowest trajectory ÷ mean",
      "description": "`rollout_engine_await_seconds_max` ÷ (`rollout_engine_await_seconds_sum` ÷ `rollout_trajectory_count`). A high ratio means a few trajectories stretch `generate`.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisLabel": "slowest ÷ mean"
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "No rollout wait counters or no per-trajectory maximum. Batched collection, Harbor and MiniSwe runners publish neither."
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "targetRef": "rl_run",
          "url": "/v1/rl/generation",
          "view": "tail_over_mean",
          "format": "timeseries",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "t",
              "text": "time",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            },
            {
              "selector": "tail_over_mean",
              "text": "tail_over_mean",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Environment wait: queue, exec and resume",
      "description": "`rollout_env_queue`, `rollout_env_exec` and `rollout_env_resume` as shares of `rollout_env_await`. A large resume share means event-loop backlog. The remainder should stay near zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "finelog-marin"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisLabel": "share of the environment wait",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "noValue": "No environment-wait counters. This build does not split the environment wait.",
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.series}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "targetRef": "rl_run",
          "url": "/v1/rl/generation",
          "view": "environment_split",
          "format": "timeseries",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "t",
              "text": "time",
              "type": "timestamp_epoch"
            },
            {
              "selector": "series",
              "text": "series",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "value",
              "text": "value",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Is vLLM slow, or under-filled?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 320,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "panelRef": "inference_status",
      "vars": {
        "identity_kind": "run_id",
        "identity": "${run}",
        "identity_override": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "panelRef": "inference_requests",
      "vars": {
        "identity_kind": "run_id",
        "identity": "${run}",
        "identity_override": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "panelRef": "inference_tokens",
      "vars": {
        "identity_kind": "run_id",
        "identity": "${run}",
        "identity_override": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "panelRef": "inference_tpot",
      "vars": {
        "identity_kind": "run_id",
        "identity": "${run}",
        "identity_override": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31
      },
      "panelRef": "inference_kv",
      "vars": {
        "identity_kind": "run_id",
        "identity": "${run}",
        "identity_override": ""
      }
    }
  ]
}
